            "value": "自動復元の時刻を確認できませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "자동 복구 시간을 확인하지 못했습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não foi possível verificar o tempo de recuperação automática."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证自动恢复的时间信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法驗證自動恢復的時間資訊。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ยืนยันเวลาการกู้คืนอัตโนมัติไม่ได้"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic safety checks stopped after three attempts. Restore your light in Settings, then turn “Keep logo on with lid closed” off and on to retry.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic safety checks stopped after three attempts. Restore your light in Settings, then turn “Keep logo on with lid closed” off and on to retry."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las comprobaciones automáticas de seguridad se detuvieron tras tres intentos. Restaura la luz en Ajustes y luego desactiva y vuelve a activar «Mantener el logo encendido con la tapa cerrada» para reintentar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les vérifications automatiques de sécurité se sont arrêtées après trois tentatives. Restaurez la lumière dans Réglages, puis désactivez et réactivez « Garder le logo allumé avec le capot fermé » pour réessayer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatische Sicherheitsprüfungen nach drei Versuchen gestoppt. In den Einstellungen das Licht wiederherstellen, dann die Deckelbeleuchtung aus- und einschalten, um es erneut zu versuchen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全確認は3回の試行後に停止しました。設定でライトを復元し、「画面を閉じてもロゴを点灯」をオフにしてからオンにすると再試行できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "안전 확인이 세 번 시도 후 중단되었습니다. 설정에서 조명을 복원한 다음 ‘덮개를 닫아도 로고 켜기’를 껐다 켜서 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As verificações automáticas de segurança pararam após três tentativas. Restaure a luz em Ajustes e depois desative e reative “Manter logo aceso com a tampa fechada” para tentar novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动安全检查已在三次尝试后停止。请在设置中恢复灯光，然后关闭并重新开启“合盖时保持徽标亮起”以重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動安全檢查已在三次嘗試後停止。請在設定中恢復燈光，然後關閉並重新開啓“合蓋時保持徽標亮起”以重試。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การตรวจความปลอดภัยอัตโนมัติหยุดหลังลองสามครั้ง กู้คืนไฟในการตั้งค่า แล้วปิดและเปิด “เปิดโลโก้ค้างไว้เมื่อปิดฝาจอ” เพื่อลองใหม่"
          }
        }
      }
    },
