    "Backlit analyzes system playback locally to make your logo respond to music. No audio is recorded or uploaded.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit analyzes system playback locally to make your logo respond to music. No audio is recorded or uploaded."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit analiza localmente el audio del sistema para que el logo responda a la música. No se graba ni se sube audio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit analyse localement le son du système pour faire réagir le logo à la musique. Aucun son n’est enregistré ni envoyé."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit analysiert die Systemwiedergabe lokal, damit Ihr Logo auf Musik reagiert. Es wird kein Audio aufgezeichnet oder hochgeladen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlitはシステムの再生音をこのMac内で解析し、音楽に合わせてロゴを光らせます。音声は録音もアップロードもしません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit은 시스템 재생 오디오를 기기에서 분석해 로고가 음악에 반응하게 합니다. 오디오를 녹음하거나 업로드하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Backlit analisa localmente o áudio do sistema para fazer o logo responder à música. Nenhum áudio é gravado ou enviado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit 在本机分析系统播放音频，使徽标响应音乐。不会录制或上传音频。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit 在本機分析系統播放音訊，使徽標響應音樂。不會錄制或上傳音訊。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit วิเคราะห์เสียงที่ระบบเล่นภายในเครื่องเพื่อให้โลโก้ตอบสนองต่อเพลง ไม่มีการบันทึกหรืออัปโหลดเสียง"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backlit could not connect system audio. Allow Backlit in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording, then reopen Backlit and retry. (macOS code {code})": {
      "comment": "Current Backlit user-visible status or actionable error. Preserve safety uncertainty, permission requirements and retained recovery state. This text is translated only for display; protocol and diagnostic payloads are unchanged. Preserve {code} verbatim: numeric macOS error code. The complete audio stage is translated as a sentence.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit could not connect system audio. Allow Backlit in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording, then reopen Backlit and retry. (macOS code {code})"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit no pudo conectar el audio del sistema. Autoriza Backlit en Ajustes del Sistema → Privacidad y seguridad → Grabación de pantalla y audio del sistema; luego vuelve a abrir Backlit y reintenta. (Código de macOS {code})"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit n’a pas pu connecter le son du système. Autorisez Backlit dans Réglages Système → Confidentialité et sécurité → Enregistrement de l’écran et de l’audio système, puis rouvrez Backlit et réessayez. (Code macOS {code})"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit konnte Systemaudio nicht verbinden. Erlauben Sie Backlit unter Systemeinstellungen → Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Bildschirm- und Systemaudioaufnahme. Öffnen Sie dann Backlit erneut und versuchen Sie es noch einmal. (macOS-Code {code})"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlitはシステムオーディオに接続できませんでした。「システム設定」→「プライバシーとセキュリティ」→「画面収録とシステムオーディオ録音」でBacklitを許可し、Backlitを開き直して再試行してください。（macOSコード {code}）"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit이 시스템 오디오에 연결하지 못했습니다. 시스템 설정 → 개인정보 보호 및 보안 → 화면 및 시스템 오디오 녹음에서 Backlit을 허용한 후 Backlit을 다시 열고 재시도하세요. (macOS 코드 {code})"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Backlit não conseguiu conectar o áudio do sistema. Permita o Backlit em Ajustes do Sistema → Privacidade e Segurança → Gravação da Tela e Áudio do Sistema; depois reabra o Backlit e tente novamente. (Código do macOS {code})"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit 无法连接系统音频。请在“系统设置”→“隐私与安全性”→“屏幕与系统音频录制”中允许 Backlit，然后重新打开 Backlit 并重试。（macOS 代码 {code}）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit 無法連接系統音訊。請在“系統設定”→“隱私與安全性”→“螢幕與系統音訊錄制”中允許 Backlit，然後重新打開 Backlit 並重試。（macOS 代碼 {code}）"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit เชื่อมต่อเสียงระบบไม่ได้ ให้อนุญาต Backlit ในการตั้งค่าระบบ → ความเป็นส่วนตัวและความปลอดภัย → การบันทึกหน้าจอและเสียงระบบ แล้วเปิด Backlit ใหม่และลองอีกครั้ง (รหัส macOS {code})"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backlit could not prepare system audio. Allow Backlit in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording, then reopen Backlit and retry. (macOS code {code})": {
      "comment": "Current Backlit user-visible status or actionable error. Preserve safety uncertainty, permission requirements and retained recovery state. This text is translated only for display; protocol and diagnostic payloads are unchanged. Preserve {code} verbatim: numeric macOS error code. The complete audio stage is translated as a sentence.",
