    "Brightness shortcuts change the manual level by 5%. They keep the current behavior and on/off state. Battery brightness stays automatic.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brightness shortcuts change the manual level by 5%. They keep the current behavior and on/off state. Battery brightness stays automatic."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los atajos de brillo cambian el nivel manual un 5%. Mantienen el comportamiento y el estado de encendido actuales. El brillo en modo Batería sigue siendo automático."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les raccourcis de luminosité modifient le niveau manuel de 5 %. Le comportement et l’état marche/arrêt restent inchangés. La luminosité du mode Batterie reste automatique."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helligkeitskurzbefehle ändern den manuellen Pegel um 5 %. Verhalten und Ein-/Aus-Zustand bleiben erhalten. Im Akkumodus bleibt die Helligkeit automatisch."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明るさのショートカットは手動の明るさを5%ずつ変更します。現在の動作とオン・オフ状態は変わりません。バッテリーモードの明るさは自動のままです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "밝기 단축키는 수동 밝기를 5%씩 변경합니다. 현재 동작과 켜짐/꺼짐 상태는 유지됩니다. 배터리 모드 밝기는 자동으로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os atalhos de brilho alteram o nível manual em 5%. Mantêm o comportamento e o estado ligado/desligado atuais. No modo Bateria, o brilho continua automático."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度快捷键每次调整手动亮度 5%，不会改变当前模式或开关状态。电池模式的亮度仍自动控制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度快捷鍵每次調整手動亮度 5%，不會改變當前模式或開關狀態。電池模式的亮度仍自動控制。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ปุ่มลัดความสว่างปรับระดับด้วยตนเองครั้งละ 5% โดยคงรูปแบบและสถานะเปิด/ปิดเดิม ความสว่างโหมดแบตเตอรี่ยังเป็นอัตโนมัติ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
