    "If Backlit is already enabled there but access is still denied after an update, remove the old Backlit entry, add the installed Backlit app again, enable it, then reopen Backlit.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Backlit is already enabled there but access is still denied after an update, remove the old Backlit entry, add the installed Backlit app again, enable it, then reopen Backlit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si Backlit ya está activado allí pero se sigue denegando el acceso tras una actualización, elimina la entrada antigua, vuelve a añadir la app Backlit instalada, actívala y vuelve a abrir Backlit."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si Backlit y est déjà activé mais que l’accès reste refusé après une mise à jour, supprimez l’ancienne entrée, ajoutez à nouveau l’app Backlit installée, activez-la, puis rouvrez Backlit."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn Backlit dort bereits aktiviert ist, der Zugriff nach einem Update aber verweigert wird: alten Eintrag entfernen, die installierte Backlit-App erneut hinzufügen und aktivieren, dann Backlit neu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アップデート後、Backlitが有効になっていてもアクセスが拒否される場合は、古いBacklitの項目を削除し、インストール済みのアプリを再追加して有効にし、Backlitを開き直してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "업데이트 후 Backlit이 이미 활성화되어 있는데도 접근이 거부되면 이전 Backlit 항목을 제거하고 설치된 앱을 다시 추가한 뒤 활성화하고 Backlit을 다시 여세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se o Backlit já estiver ativado ali, mas o acesso continuar negado após uma atualização, remova a entrada antiga, adicione novamente o app Backlit instalado, ative-o e reabra o Backlit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果更新后 Backlit 已启用但仍被拒绝访问，请移除旧的 Backlit 条目，重新添加已安装的 Backlit 应用并启用，然后重新打开 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果更新後 Backlit 已啓用但仍被拒絕訪問，請移除舊的 Backlit 條目，重新添加已安裝的 Backlit 應用並啓用，然後重新打開 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "หากเปิดสิทธิ์ Backlit แล้วแต่ยังถูกปฏิเสธหลังอัปเดต ให้ลบรายการ Backlit เก่า เพิ่มแอป Backlit ที่ติดตั้งไว้อีกครั้ง เปิดสิทธิ์ แล้วเปิด Backlit ใหม่"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If access is off, allow Backlit in Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If access is off, allow Backlit in Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si no tiene acceso, autoriza Backlit en Privacidad y seguridad → Grabación de pantalla y audio del sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si l’accès est désactivé, autorisez Backlit dans Confidentialité et sécurité → Enregistrement de l’écran et de l’audio système."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei fehlendem Zugriff Backlit unter Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Bildschirm- und Systemaudioaufnahme erlauben."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アクセスがオフの場合は「プライバシーとセキュリティ」→「画面収録とシステムオーディオ録音」でBacklitを許可してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "접근이 꺼져 있으면 개인정보 보호 및 보안 → 화면 및 시스템 오디오 녹음에서 Backlit을 허용하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se o acesso estiver desativado, permita o Backlit em Privacidade e Segurança → Gravação da Tela e Áudio do Sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若访问权限关闭，请在“隐私与安全性”→“屏幕与系统音频录制”中允许 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若訪問權限關閉，請在“隱私與安全性”→“螢幕與系統音訊錄制”中允許 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "หากปิดสิทธิ์อยู่ ให้อนุญาต Backlit ในความเป็นส่วนตัวและความปลอดภัย → การบันทึกหน้าจอและเสียงระบบ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In-app updates aren’t enabled for this build yet. A trusted update feed and signing key must be included by the publisher.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In-app updates aren’t enabled for this build yet. A trusted update feed and signing key must be included by the publisher."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las actualizaciones dentro de la app aún no están activadas en esta compilación. El editor debe incluir una fuente de actualizaciones de confianza y una clave de firma."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mises à jour intégrées ne sont pas encore activées dans cette version. L’éditeur doit inclure un flux de mises à jour fiable et une clé de signature."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In-App-Updates sind in diesem Build noch nicht aktiviert. Der Herausgeber muss eine vertrauenswürdige Updatequelle und einen Signaturschlüssel einbinden."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このビルドではアプリ内アップデートはまだ有効ではありません。発行元が信頼できる更新フィードと署名キーを含める必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 빌드에서는 앱 내 업데이트가 아직 활성화되지 않았습니다. 배포자가 신뢰할 수 있는 업데이트 피드와 서명 키를 포함해야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As atualizações no app ainda não estão ativadas nesta compilação. O publicador precisa incluir uma fonte de atualizações confiável e uma chave de assinatura."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此构建版本尚未启用应用内更新。发布者需提供可信的更新源和签名密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此構建版本尚未啓用應用內更新。發佈者需提供可信的更新源和簽名金鑰。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "บิลด์นี้ยังไม่เปิดอัปเดตในแอป ผู้เผยแพร่ต้องใส่ฟีดอัปเดตที่เชื่อถือได้และคีย์ลงนาม"
          }
        }
      }
    },
