    "Keeps this Mac awake and may leave its built-in screen lit while closed. Limited to 30 minutes; also stops for low battery, heat or Low Power Mode. Keep it on a hard, ventilated surface, never in a bag.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps this Mac awake and may leave its built-in screen lit while closed. Limited to 30 minutes; also stops for low battery, heat or Low Power Mode. Keep it on a hard, ventilated surface, never in a bag."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantiene este Mac despierto y puede dejar encendida la pantalla integrada con la tapa cerrada. Límite de 30 minutos; también se detiene si la batería está baja, hay calor excesivo o está activado el modo de bajo consumo. Colócalo sobre una superficie dura y ventilada, nunca dentro de una bolsa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintient ce Mac éveillé et peut laisser son écran intégré allumé lorsque le capot est fermé. Limité à 30 minutes ; s’arrête aussi si la batterie est faible, en cas de chaleur ou en mode économie d’énergie. Posez-le sur une surface dure et ventilée, jamais dans un sac."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hält diesen Mac wach; das eingebaute Display kann bei geschlossenem Deckel weiter leuchten. Auf 30 Minuten begrenzt; stoppt auch bei niedrigem Akkustand, Hitze oder Stromsparmodus. Nur auf einer festen, gut belüfteten Fläche verwenden, niemals in einer Tasche."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Macをスリープさせず、画面を閉じても内蔵ディスプレイが点灯し続ける場合があります。上限は30分で、低残量、高温、低電力モードでも停止します。通気のよい硬い面に置き、絶対にバッグに入れないでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac을 깨어 있게 유지하며 덮개를 닫아도 내장 화면이 켜져 있을 수 있습니다. 최대 30분이며 배터리 부족, 과열 또는 저전력 모드에서도 중단됩니다. 통풍이 잘되는 단단한 표면에 놓고 절대 가방에 넣지 마세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantém este Mac ativo e pode deixar a tela integrada acesa com a tampa fechada. Limitado a 30 minutos; também para por bateria fraca, calor ou Modo de Pouca Energia. Deixe-o em uma superfície rígida e ventilada, nunca em uma bolsa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让此 Mac 保持唤醒，合盖后内置屏幕可能仍亮着。最长 30 分钟；低电量、过热或低电量模式下也会停止。请置于坚硬、通风的表面，切勿放入包中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "闔蓋時 Mac 保持喚醒，內建螢幕可能仍亮著。最長 30 分鐘；電量不足、過熱或開啟低耗電模式時也會停止。請放在通風的硬質平面上，切勿放入袋中。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ทำให้ Mac ไม่พักเครื่อง และหน้าจอในตัวอาจยังสว่างขณะปิดฝา จำกัด 30 นาที และหยุดเมื่อแบตเตอรี่ต่ำ เครื่องร้อน หรือเปิดโหมดพลังงานต่ำ วางบนพื้นแข็งที่ระบายอากาศได้ดี ห้ามใส่ในกระเป๋าเด็ดขาด"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard safety controls are unavailable. Closed-lid lighting was not enabled.": {
      "comment": "Current Backlit user-visible status or actionable error. Preserve safety uncertainty, permission requirements and retained recovery state. This text is translated only for display; protocol and diagnostic payloads are unchanged.",
