    "System audio access is off for Backlit. Allow it in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording, then reopen Backlit or choose Retry System Audio. Backlit does not record your screen or microphone.": {
      "comment": "Current Backlit user-visible status or actionable error. Preserve safety uncertainty, permission requirements and retained recovery state. This text is translated only for display; protocol and diagnostic payloads are unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System audio access is off for Backlit. Allow it in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording, then reopen Backlit or choose Retry System Audio. Backlit does not record your screen or microphone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El acceso al audio del sistema está desactivado para Backlit. Autorízalo en Ajustes del Sistema → Privacidad y seguridad → Grabación de pantalla y audio del sistema; luego vuelve a abrir Backlit o elige Reintentar audio del sistema. Backlit no graba la pantalla ni el micrófono."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’accès au son du système est désactivé pour Backlit. Autorisez-le dans Réglages Système → Confidentialité et sécurité → Enregistrement de l’écran et de l’audio système, puis rouvrez Backlit ou choisissez Réessayer le son du système. Backlit n’enregistre ni votre écran ni votre microphone."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Systemaudio-Zugriff für Backlit ist aus. Erlauben Sie Backlit unter Systemeinstellungen → Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Bildschirm- und Systemaudioaufnahme. Öffnen Sie dann Backlit erneut oder wählen Sie „Systemaudio erneut versuchen“. Backlit zeichnet weder Bildschirm noch Mikrofon auf."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlitのシステムオーディオへのアクセスはオフです。「システム設定」→「プライバシーとセキュリティ」→「画面収録とシステムオーディオ録音」で許可し、Backlitを開き直すか「システムオーディオを再試行」を選択してください。Backlitは画面やマイクを録画・録音しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit의 시스템 오디오 접근이 꺼져 있습니다. 시스템 설정 → 개인정보 보호 및 보안 → 화면 및 시스템 오디오 녹음에서 허용한 뒤 Backlit을 다시 열거나 ‘시스템 오디오 재시도’를 선택하세요. Backlit은 화면이나 마이크를 녹화·녹음하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O acesso ao áudio do sistema está desativado para o Backlit. Permita-o em Ajustes do Sistema → Privacidade e Segurança → Gravação da Tela e Áudio do Sistema; depois reabra o Backlit ou escolha Tentar áudio do sistema novamente. O Backlit não grava sua tela nem seu microfone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit 的系统音频访问已关闭。请在“系统设置”→“隐私与安全性”→“屏幕与系统音频录制”中允许 Backlit，然后重新打开 Backlit 或选择“重试系统音频”。Backlit 不录制屏幕或麦克风。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit 的系統音訊訪問已關閉。請在“系統設定”→“隱私與安全性”→“螢幕與系統音訊錄制”中允許 Backlit，然後重新打開 Backlit 或選擇“重試系統音訊”。Backlit 不錄制螢幕或麥克風。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ปิดสิทธิ์เสียงระบบของ Backlit อยู่ ให้อนุญาตในการตั้งค่าระบบ → ความเป็นส่วนตัวและความปลอดภัย → การบันทึกหน้าจอและเสียงระบบ แล้วเปิด Backlit ใหม่หรือเลือก “ลองเสียงระบบอีกครั้ง” Backlit ไม่บันทึกหน้าจอหรือไมโครโฟน"
          }
        }
      }
    },
