    "The logo hardware produces white light. Backlit changes its brightness and rhythm, never the screen brightness. ": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The logo hardware produces white light. Backlit changes its brightness and rhythm, never the screen brightness. "
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El hardware del logo produce luz blanca. Backlit cambia su brillo y ritmo, nunca el brillo de la pantalla. "
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le matériel du logo produit une lumière blanche. Backlit modifie sa luminosité et son rythme, jamais la luminosité de l’écran. "
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Logo-Hardware erzeugt weißes Licht. Backlit ändert Helligkeit und Rhythmus, niemals die Bildschirmhelligkeit. "
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ロゴのハードウェアは白色光を発します。Backlitが変更するのはロゴの明るさとリズムだけで、画面の明るさは変更しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "로고 하드웨어는 흰빛을 냅니다. Backlit은 로고의 밝기와 리듬만 바꾸며 화면 밝기는 바꾸지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O hardware do logo produz luz branca. O Backlit altera seu brilho e ritmo, nunca o brilho da tela. "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "徽标硬件发出白光。Backlit 只改变其亮度和节奏，绝不改变屏幕亮度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "徽標硬體發出白光。Backlit 只改變其亮度和節奏，絕不改變螢幕亮度。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ฮาร์ดแวร์โลโก้ให้แสงสีขาว Backlit เปลี่ยนเฉพาะความสว่างและจังหวะของโลโก้ ไม่เปลี่ยนความสว่างหน้าจอ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
