    "Works with any app open. Rest a finger to light the logo; lift all fingers to turn it off.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works with any app open. Rest a finger to light the logo; lift all fingers to turn it off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funciona con cualquier app abierta. Apoya un dedo para encender el logo; levanta todos los dedos para apagarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fonctionne avec n’importe quelle app ouverte. Posez un doigt pour allumer le logo ; retirez tous les doigts pour l’éteindre."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funktioniert in jeder geöffneten App. Finger auflegen, um das Logo zu beleuchten; alle Finger abheben, um es auszuschalten."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どのアプリを開いていても動作します。指を置くと点灯し、すべての指を離すと消灯します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "어떤 앱이 열려 있어도 작동합니다. 손가락을 올리면 켜지고 모두 떼면 꺼집니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funciona com qualquer app aberto. Apoie um dedo para acender o logo; levante todos os dedos para apagá-lo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于任意打开的应用。放上一根手指可点亮徽标，抬起所有手指即可熄灭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適用於任意打開的應用。放上一根手指可點亮徽標，抬起所有手指即可熄滅。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ทำงานได้ขณะเปิดแอปใดก็ได้ วางนิ้วเพื่อให้โลโก้สว่าง ยกนิ้วทั้งหมดเพื่อดับไฟ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can switch modes or quit Backlit. Retry becomes available after cleanup finishes.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can switch modes or quit Backlit. Retry becomes available after cleanup finishes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes cambiar de modo o salir de Backlit. Podrás reintentar cuando termine la liberación de recursos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez changer de mode ou quitter Backlit. Réessayer sera possible une fois le nettoyage terminé."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie können den Modus wechseln oder Backlit beenden. Nach der Bereinigung ist ein neuer Versuch möglich."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "モードの切り替えやBacklitの終了は可能です。後処理が終わると再試行できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "모드를 바꾸거나 Backlit을 종료할 수 있습니다. 정리가 끝나면 재시도할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pode mudar de modo ou sair do Backlit. Será possível tentar novamente após a liberação dos recursos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您可以切换模式或退出 Backlit。清理完成后可重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您可以切換模式或退出 Backlit。清理完成後可重試。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "สลับโหมดหรือออกจาก Backlit ได้ ลองใหม่ได้เมื่อการล้างสถานะเสร็จสิ้น"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your assistant may send light status to its model provider. Music and Typing need access enabled in Backlit first. Status hooks stay separate.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your assistant may send light status to its model provider. Music and Typing need access enabled in Backlit first. Status hooks stay separate."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu asistente puede enviar el estado de la luz al proveedor de su modelo. Primero debes permitir el acceso a Música y Escritura en Backlit. Los hooks de estado son independientes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre assistant peut transmettre l’état de la lumière au fournisseur de son modèle. L’accès à Musique et Saisie doit d’abord être activé dans Backlit. Les hooks d’état restent indépendants."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr Assistent kann den Lichtstatus an seinen Modellanbieter senden. Für Musik und Tippen muss der Zugriff zuerst in Backlit erlaubt werden. Status-Hooks bleiben getrennt."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アシスタントがライトの状態をモデル提供元に送信する場合があります。音楽とタイピングには、まずBacklitでアクセスを有効にする必要があります。状態フックは独立しています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "어시스턴트가 조명 상태를 모델 제공업체로 보낼 수 있습니다. 음악과 타이핑은 먼저 Backlit에서 접근을 활성화해야 합니다. 상태 훅은 별개로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu assistente pode enviar o status da luz ao provedor do modelo. O acesso a Música e Digitação precisa ser ativado no Backlit primeiro. Os hooks de status são independentes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手可能向其模型提供商发送灯光状态。音乐和打字模式需要先在 Backlit 中启用访问权限。状态钩子仍保持独立。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手可能向其模型提供商發送燈光狀態。音樂和打字模式需要先在 Backlit 中啓用訪問權限。狀態鈎子仍保持獨立。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ผู้ช่วยอาจส่งสถานะไฟให้ผู้ให้บริการโมเดล ต้องเปิดสิทธิ์เพลงและการพิมพ์ใน Backlit ก่อน ฮุกสถานะยังแยกกัน"
          }
        }
      }
    },
