    "macOS did not allow the brightness-key filter. Review Accessibility and Input Monitoring, or use the regular shortcuts.": {
      "comment": "Current Backlit user-visible status or actionable error. Preserve safety uncertainty, permission requirements and retained recovery state. This text is translated only for display; protocol and diagnostic payloads are unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS did not allow the brightness-key filter. Review Accessibility and Input Monitoring, or use the regular shortcuts."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS no permitió el filtro de teclas de brillo. Revisa Accesibilidad y Monitorización de entrada, o usa los atajos normales."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS n’a pas autorisé le filtre des touches de luminosité. Vérifiez Accessibilité et Surveillance de l’entrée, ou utilisez les raccourcis habituels."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS hat den Helligkeitstastenfilter nicht erlaubt. Prüfen Sie Bedienungshilfen und Eingabeüberwachung oder verwenden Sie normale Kurzbefehle."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOSが明るさキーのフィルタを許可しませんでした。アクセシビリティと入力監視の設定を確認するか、通常のショートカットを使用してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS가 밝기 키 필터를 허용하지 않았습니다. 손쉬운 사용 및 입력 모니터링 설정을 확인하거나 일반 단축키를 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS não permitiu o filtro de teclas de brilho. Revise Acessibilidade e Monitoramento de Entrada ou use os atalhos comuns."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 未允许亮度键过滤器。请检查“辅助功能”和“输入监控”，或使用普通快捷键。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
