        }
      }
    },
    "macOS still denies Input Monitoring for this running Backlit. Open Input Monitoring and grant access to the installed app, then reopen Backlit.": {
      "comment": "Current Backlit user-visible status or actionable error. Preserve safety uncertainty, permission requirements and retained recovery state. This text is translated only for display; protocol and diagnostic payloads are unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS still denies Input Monitoring for this running Backlit. Open Input Monitoring and grant access to the installed app, then reopen Backlit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS sigue denegando Monitorización de entrada a esta instancia de Backlit. Abre Monitorización de entrada, concede acceso a la app instalada y vuelve a abrir Backlit."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS refuse toujours Surveillance de l’entrée à cette instance de Backlit. Ouvrez Surveillance de l’entrée, accordez l’accès à l’app installée, puis rouvrez Backlit."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS verweigert dieser laufenden Backlit-App weiterhin die Eingabeüberwachung. Öffnen Sie „Eingabeüberwachung“, erlauben Sie der installierten App den Zugriff und öffnen Sie Backlit erneut."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実行中のBacklitへの入力監視をmacOSがまだ拒否しています。「入力監視」を開き、インストール済みのアプリを許可してからBacklitを開き直してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS가 실행 중인 Backlit의 입력 모니터링을 여전히 거부합니다. 입력 모니터링을 열어 설치된 앱에 접근을 허용한 후 Backlit을 다시 여세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS ainda nega o Monitoramento de Entrada a esta instância do Backlit. Abra Monitoramento de Entrada, conceda acesso ao app instalado e reabra o Backlit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 仍拒绝当前运行的 Backlit 使用输入监控。请打开“输入监控”，向已安装的应用授予访问权限，然后重新打开 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 仍拒絕當前運行的 Backlit 使用輸入監控。請打開“輸入監控”，向已安裝的應用授予訪問權限，然後重新打開 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS ยังปฏิเสธการตรวจดูอินพุตสำหรับ Backlit ที่กำลังทำงาน เปิดการตรวจดูอินพุตและให้สิทธิ์แอปที่ติดตั้งไว้ แล้วเปิด Backlit ใหม่"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS stopped hardware-key control. Brightness keys use macOS again; use the regular shortcuts or enable the option again.": {
      "comment": "Current Backlit user-visible status or actionable error. Preserve safety uncertainty, permission requirements and retained recovery state. This text is translated only for display; protocol and diagnostic payloads are unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS stopped hardware-key control. Brightness keys use macOS again; use the regular shortcuts or enable the option again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS detuvo el control de teclas físicas. Las teclas de brillo vuelven a usar macOS; usa los atajos normales o activa la opción de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a arrêté le contrôle des touches physiques. Les touches de luminosité sont de nouveau gérées par macOS ; utilisez les raccourcis habituels ou réactivez l’option."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS hat die Hardware-Tastensteuerung gestoppt. Helligkeitstasten werden wieder von macOS gesteuert. Verwenden Sie normale Kurzbefehle oder aktivieren Sie die Option erneut."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOSがハードウェアキーの制御を停止しました。明るさキーは再びmacOSが処理します。通常のショートカットを使用するか、この設定を再度有効にしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS가 하드웨어 키 제어를 중단했습니다. 밝기 키는 다시 macOS에서 처리합니다. 일반 단축키를 사용하거나 해당 옵션을 다시 활성화하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS interrompeu o controle das teclas físicas. As teclas de brilho voltaram a usar o macOS; use os atalhos comuns ou ative a opção novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 已停止硬件按键控制。亮度键已恢复由 macOS 处理；请使用普通快捷键或重新启用该选项。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 已停止硬體按鍵控制。亮度鍵已恢復由 macOS 處理；請使用一般快捷鍵或重新啟用此選項。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
